{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch01","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[74],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.011","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"含参数 a 的积分平均极限等于 1，求 a（a>−1 且 a≠0）。","topic_tags":["积分极限","对数极限"],"type_pool":"极限","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"a=1","official_analysis":"洛必达化为 t=1/x→0⁺ 的两差商；第一项极限为 a，第二项为 0。","independent_check":"由给定极限=1，故 a=1，且符合限制。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[22],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch02","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[75],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.012","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"0<x₁<π，xₙ₊₁=sin xₙ：证明收敛并求值；再求指定比幂极限。","topic_tags":["数列极限","递推数列","等价无穷小"],"type_pool":"数列极限","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"lim xₙ=0","official_analysis":"0<sin x<x（x>0），单调递减且下有界；极限满足 A=sin A。","independent_check":"唯一非负不动点为 0。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"e^(−1/6)","official_analysis":"用 sin t/t=1−t²/6+o(t²) 处理指数型极限。","independent_check":"取对数后极限为 −1/6。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[23],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch02","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[76],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.013","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"x₁>0，xₙ₊₁=ln(e^{xₙ}−1)−ln xₙ：证明收敛并求极限。","topic_tags":["数列极限","单调有界"],"type_pool":"数列极限","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"lim xₙ=0","official_analysis":"e^x−1>x 保正；中值定理给 xₙ₊₁=e^ξₙ<xₙ，故单调有界，再代入极限方程。","independent_check":"A e^A=e^A−1 的非负解为 0。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[23],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch01","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[77,78,79],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.014","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"三组连乘/根式乘积极限。","topic_tags":["无穷乘积","三角极限"],"type_pool":"极限","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"1/(1−x)，|x|<1","official_analysis":"(1−x)(1+x)…(1+x^(2^n))=1−x^(2^(n+1))。","independent_check":"|x|<1 时幂项趋零。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"sin x/x，x≠0","official_analysis":"反复使用 sin(2u)=2sin u cos u。","independent_check":"望远镜化简后取极限。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(III)","formal_answer":"1/n!","official_analysis":"1−根式用共轭/因式分解，逐因子化为 1/k。","independent_check":"有限连乘为 1/(2·3···n)。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[23,24],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch01","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[80,81],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.015","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"两道由给定极限反求极限。","topic_tags":["等价无穷小","多项式零点"],"type_pool":"极限","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"(ln a)/2","official_analysis":"a^x−1~x ln a，ln(1+f(x)/sin x) 与其同阶。","independent_check":"先得 f(x)/sin x~x ln a/2，再用 sin x~x。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"−1/2","official_analysis":"两给定有限极限强制 f(2a)=f(4a)=0；按三次多项式分解并联立系数。","independent_check":"f(x)=(x−2a)(x−4a)(x−3a)/(2a²)，代入求得。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[24],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch02","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[82],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.016","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"x₁=1/2，xₙ₊₁=xₙ²+xₙ，求 Σ 1/(xₖ+1) 的极限。","topic_tags":["数列极限","裂项"],"type_pool":"数列极限","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"2","official_analysis":"1/(xₙ+1)=1/xₙ−1/xₙ₊₁，且 xₙ→∞。","independent_check":"部分和=2−1/xₙ₊₁→2。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[24,25],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch02","source_section":"高数第一章｜综合解答","source_pdf_pages":[83],"item_ref":"ch01.comprehensive.solution.017","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"aₙ=∫₀¹sin(xⁿ)dx，bₙ=∫₀¹sinⁿx dx：证明大小关系并求共同极限。","topic_tags":["数列极限","夹逼准则"],"type_pool":"数列极限","subquestions":[{"label":"(I)","formal_answer":"0≤bₙ≤aₙ","official_analysis":"[0,1] 上 sin(xⁿ)≥sinⁿx≥0。","independent_check":"比较函数单调性及 x≥sin x。","status":"verified"},{"label":"(II)","formal_answer":"lim aₙ=lim bₙ=0","official_analysis":"0≤sin(xⁿ)≤xⁿ，积分上界 1/(n+1)。","independent_check":"再由 (I) 夹逼。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[25],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:12:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
